# Kellan, Inquisitive Prodigy // Tail the Suspect (CR 715): "Investigate. You may play an additional land this turn." On turn 1 Bot1 plays a
# Forest, casts Tail the Suspect for {G}{U} from a Mox Emerald and a Mox Sapphire, and gets a Clue; it then plays an Island as its second
# land, and a third is refused (exactly one additional land, CR 305.2). The Adventure card goes to exile, not the graveyard. On turn 3 the
# permission has ended (until end of turn): one Island is played and the next refused, and Kellan is cast from exile for {2}{G}{U}.

